        "subject": "100 tote bags – comparison for 07:00 review",
        "body": "Morning review – 100 tote bags for Bergen customer day Thu Nov 12:\n\nJob: delivered to our Oslo office by Tue Nov 10, 16:00 (team carries to Bergen Wed Nov 11). Budget up to NOK 3,500 including freight.\n\n1. Nordtrykk AS – NOK 22 per bag, pickup in Oslo, no freight. Total NOK 2,200. Published lead time: 10 working days from artwork approval. From Tue Nov 3 this cannot meet Tue Nov 10. Verified delivery: No.\n\n2. Baltic Print OÜ Quote Q-1187 – NOK 18 per bag + NOK 350 freight = NOK 2,150. States: delivered to your address by 9 November. Valid until Nov 5. Shipping terms state transit times are estimates and delivery dates refer to dispatch unless the quote states a guaranteed arrival date. Q-1187 does not state guaranteed arrival, so arrival is not verified. Verified delivery: No.\n\n3. Vestland Tekstil (portal v1) – NOK 24 per bag + NOK 400 van = NOK 2,800. Production run Fri Nov 6, last before Nov 16. Oslo freight for the Nov 6 run is full. Bergen van to Bergen addresses, window Wed Nov 11 08:00-12:00, guaranteed. Sjøsalen confirms: deliveries can be received Wed Nov 11, 08:00-16:00 at the goods entrance. This covers the van window and is in time for Thu Nov 12 event. Verified delivery: Yes, to Sjøsalen only.\n\nAction taken overnight under standing permission: submitted one non-binding, free capacity-hold H-2041 on Vestland portal for 100 tote bags with logo, print file fjord-fern-logo-print.pdf, to Sjøsalen, Sjøgaten 5, 5003 Bergen, window Wed Nov 11 08:00-12:00, contact Kari Strandli. Hold ends 09:00. No order, no payment, no emails sent.\n\nDecision needed at 07:00: approve Vestland Bergen order, or give alternative. Nothing has been sent to any supplier or venue.",
